---
export const prerender = true;

import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="The Library in brief · America's School Trust Library"
  description="A 20-page portrait of America's School Trust Library: what the school-land promise is, where its records live, what the Library holds, the standard it keeps, and the people who sign for it."
  sourceId="booklet"
>
  <article class="prose prose-slate max-w-none prose-a:text-blue-700 prose-a:underline">
    <p class="kicker">Library publication</p>
    <h1>The Library in brief</h1>

    <p>
      A 20-page portrait of America's School Trust Library: what the
      school-land promise is, where its records live, what the Library holds,
      the standard it keeps, and the people who sign for it. Published
      August 10, 2026. First edition, working draft — like everything here,
      corrected in public when it is wrong.
    </p>

    <p class="cover-figure">
      <a href="/booklet/americas-school-trust-library-booklet-web.pdf">
        <img
          src="/booklet/booklet-cover.jpg"
          alt="Cover of the booklet: America's School Trust Library — A building made of records"
          width="963"
          height="1238"
          class="cover-img"
        />
      </a>
    </p>

    <p>
      Read or download: Web copy (PDF, 4 MB) —
      <a href="/booklet/americas-school-trust-library-booklet-web.pdf">/booklet/americas-school-trust-library-booklet-web.pdf</a>
      · Press-quality copy (PDF, 13 MB) —
      <a href="/booklet/americas-school-trust-library-booklet-press.pdf">/booklet/americas-school-trust-library-booklet-press.pdf</a>
    </p>

    <p class="hash-note">
      The booklet is a Library publication and is catalogued like any other
      holding. SHA-256: web
      <code>926e1a184aad7d4961adb254a1bf69da009021d6a0122c4145dbbe577fd3ad67</code>
      · press
      <code>51d5ac3f90a0b9a876b77bada71b7e0f623c966fddb1baf461903259ca1938d5</code>
    </p>
  </article>

  <style>
    .kicker {
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #A88A4E;
      margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
    }
    .cover-figure {
      margin: 1.5rem 0;
    }
    .cover-img {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 320px;
      height: auto;
      display: block;
      border: 1px solid rgba(22, 51, 92, 0.18);
      border-radius: 3px;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(14, 32, 56, 0.18);
      margin: 0;
    }
    .hash-note {
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: #4e617c;
    }
    .hash-note code {
      font-size: 0.78em;
      word-break: break-all;
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
